#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:146
#: 212b0faf793641b891fdf70d446bf15f
msgid ""
"Prior to the next screen, a compatibility test runs to check whether IOMMU-"
"virtualization is active or not. If the test fails, a window will pop up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:148
#: 0997cc437b8b4bbda68ba5bd21976988
msgid "|Unsupported hardware detected|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:382
#: 0d14888ccae04ec1ba6ef5412e627dbc
msgid "Unsupported hardware detected"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:150
#: a1890d4697d1458bb0d6e885231f0d3f
msgid ""
"Do not panic. It may simply indicate that IOMMU-virtualization hasn’t been "
"activated in the BIOS or UEFI. Return to the :ref:`user/downloading-"
"installing-upgrading/installation-guide:hardware requirements` section to "
"learn how to activate it. If the setting is not configured correctly, it "
"means that your hardware won’t be able to leverage some Qubes security "
"features, such as a strict isolation of the networking and USB hardware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:152
#: 115a13310bda45f5b2134e7abe4f74b1
msgid ""
"If the test passes, you will reach the installation summary screen. The "
"installer loads Xen right at the beginning. If you can see the installer’s "
"graphical screen, and you pass the compatibility check that runs immediately "
"afterward, Qubes OS is likely to work on your system!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:154
#: 1f38568d32e14b54ac9911eec6c16e44
msgid ""
"Like Fedora, Qubes OS uses the Anaconda installer. Those that are familiar "
"with RPM-based distributions should feel at home."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:157
#: 5379ee3a691744a0b95b2de615242297
msgid "Installation summary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:160
#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:206
#: 646f2bcde90d4110be6369d95bff47e7 432bf7bd9bc44312adc3b377b00fd1e8
